negative two is positive twenty four. And

233
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:43,664
divide the whole numerator by two a.

234
00:16:44,800 --> 00:16:50,078
Your turn. Solve x squared minus two x
minus four equals zero with the formula.

235
00:16:50,078 --> 00:16:51,882
Pause the video and try it.

236
00:16:56,400 --> 00:17:01,942
The discriminant is four plus sixteen,
twenty. x equals two plus or minus root

237
00:17:01,942 --> 00:17:05,850
twenty, over two, which is one plus or
minus root five.

238
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:11,380
The part under the square root in the
quadratic formula tells you how many

239
00:17:11,380 --> 00:17:13,571
solutions there are, without solving.

240
00:17:14,700 --> 00:17:17,751
b squared minus four a c is called the
discriminant.

241
00:17:18,201 --> 00:17:20,867
It decides whether the square root is a
real number.

242
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:25,520
If the discriminant is positive, there are
two real solutions.

243
00:17:25,970 --> 00:17:31,614
For x squared minus five x plus six, it's
twenty-five minus twenty-four, which is

244
00:17:31,614 --> 00:17:35,655
one. Two solutions. The parabola crosses
the x axis twice.

245
00:17:36,800 --> 00:17:39,232
If it's zero, there's exactly one
solution.

246
00:17:39,682 --> 00:17:45,216
For x squared minus six x plus nine, it's
thirty-six minus thirty-six, which is

247
00:17:45,216 --> 00:17:49,069
zero. The parabola just touches the axis
at its vertex.

248
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:52,760
If it's negative, there are no real
solutions.

249
00:17:53,210 --> 00:17:58,764
For x squared plus x plus three, it's one
minus twelve, which is negative eleven.

250
00:17:58,764 --> 00:18:00,890
The parabola misses the x axis.

251
00:18:02,033 --> 00:18:04,636
The discriminant is a quick check before
you solve.

252
00:18:05,086 --> 00:18:09,772
If it's a perfect square, like one or
twenty-five, the quadratic also factors

253
00:18:09,772 --> 00:18:10,867
over the integers.

254
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:17,647
Your turn. How many real solutions does
two x squared plus four x plus five equals

255
00:18:17,647 --> 00:18:18,336
zero have?

256
00:18:18,786 --> 00:18:20,237
Pause the video and try it.

257
00:18:20,687 --> 00:18:25,397
Sixteen minus forty is negative
twenty-four. It's negative, so there are

258
00:18:25,397 --> 00:18:26,575
