264
00:18:57,100 --> 00:19:00,620
For b, it's one minus twenty four,
negative twenty three.

265
00:19:01,767 --> 00:19:06,737
Negative means no real solutions. The
parabola never reaches the x axis.

266
00:19:07,867 --> 00:19:10,576
For c, it's twenty five plus four, twenty
nine.

267
00:19:11,700 --> 00:19:13,812
Positive means two real solutions.

268
00:19:14,933 --> 00:19:18,795
Equation a has one real solution, b has
none, and c has two.

269
00:19:19,933 --> 00:19:24,695
Watch out. The discriminant is b squared
minus four a c. Positive means two

270
00:19:24,695 --> 00:19:29,837
solutions, zero means one, and negative
means none. And if it's a perfect square,

271
00:19:29,837 --> 00:19:33,139
