337
00:24:14,867 --> 00:24:19,872
A thirty five dollar ticket maximizes
revenue at twelve thousand two hundred

338
00:24:19,872 --> 00:24:24,877
fifty dollars. Any price from twenty to
fifty dollars brings in at least ten

339
00:24:24,877 --> 00:24:25,469
thousand.

340
00:24:26,600 --> 00:24:31,380
Watch out. Revenue is price times
quantity. Define x clearly; here it's the

341
00:24:31,380 --> 00:24:36,542
